{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>WatermarkIT 是一款專為攝影師、創作者及中小企業設計的照片標記應用，現正限時免費下載。這款工具能協助用戶在 iPhone 上輕鬆添加 Logo、文字、手寫簽名或 QR Code，確保作品版權歸屬清晰，同時保障隱私安全。</p>\n\n<h2>多重防裁切與批量處理</h2>\n<p>此應用提供平鋪重複標記功能，讓水印覆蓋整張圖片，防止被簡單裁切；並支援將版權資訊寫入檔案元數據。用戶可調整字體、顏色、旋轉角度及位置，更能透過批量模式一次處理多張照片，或運用內建預設快速套用不同場景的樣式，所有運算均在本地完成，無需上傳雲端，兼顧效率與私隱保護。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：WatermarkIT: Photo Watermark</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T02:19:46.164025+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}